<section image-layout="blank" id="AfZ89A3Jod" vertical-align="center"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="o8wl1mkOnd"><p role="eyebrow">Illustrative calculation · 12 ha · USD</p><h2>Reproduce the calculation</h2><p font-size="lg">Follow the units through each link. The effective capacity calculated in step three becomes the denominator for both cost figures.</p><grid marker="number" marker-rule="true" marker-position="above" marker-align="start" marker-numbering-format="decimal-leading-zero" spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug" style="--marker-gap:0.6em"><grid-item id="3ArsRtp0x6" colspan="15"><h4>State the inputs</h4><p>Width 2.0 m; speed 5.0 km/h; efficiency 0.70; hourly cost $54.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="nM6KrQnELI" colspan="15"><h4>Find theoretical capacity</h4><formula>C_t=2.0\times5.0\div10=1.00</formula><p>ha/hour before field losses.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="1kHpsaGXQZ" colspan="15"><h4>Apply field efficiency</h4><formula>C_e=1.00\times0.70=0.70</formula><p>ha/hour effective capacity.</p></grid-item><grid-item id="vWBfIBT-cV" colspan="15"><h4>Convert capacity to cost</h4><formula>54\div0.70=77.14</formula><p>$77.14/ha</p><formula>54\times12\div0.70=925.71</formula><p>$925.71 for 12 ha.</p></grid-item></grid><p font-size="12pt"><span text-color="muted">Cost-method reference:</span> <a href="https://www.extension.iastate.edu/agdm/crops/html/a3-29.html">Iowa State University Extension, Ag Decision Maker A3-29</a> · Illustrative USD; excludes taxes, financing terms, subsidies and policy effects.</p></grid-item></grid></section>